# Build context of backend/Dockerfile is the repository root (see render.yaml). Without
# this file, every build would upload orekit-data (~100 MB, fetched inside the image
# anyway), node_modules and the git history to the daemon before the first step runs.
.git
orekit-data/
**/target/
.venv*/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/
**/.DS_Store
